{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29566","headline":"银河吹笙 · 李商隐","name":"银河吹笙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怅望银河吹玉笙，楼寒院冷接平明。\n重衾幽梦他年断，别树羁雌昨夜惊。\n月榭故香因雨发，风帘残烛隔霜清。\n不须浪作缑山意，湘瑟秦箫自有情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}